# Jar classpath captured from the connector image
# solace/solace-pubsub-connector-ibmmq:3.1.0
#
# The first 3.x capture. Connector 3.x runs on Spring Boot 4 and Jackson 3,
# which the 2.x list cannot speak for. This list describes 3.1.0 and later,
# before 3.2.0 (its row in libs.embeddedLists): 3.2.0 ships the same jars at
# newer versions -- the connector framework (4.2.0 to 4.3.6), its JMS binders
# (5.0.0-M4 to 5.0.3), Jackson (3.2.1 to 3.2.2) and the Solace starters -- so
# it has a list of its own. No 3.0.x release has been captured, so none is
# covered. Recapture from a newer image and diff before adding one -- an
# identical capture means a list already covers that release and only its
# range's evidence changed.
#
# Regenerate with:
#   docker run --rm --entrypoint sh solace/solace-pubsub-connector-ibmmq:3.1.0 -c 'find / -name "*.jar" -not -path "/proc/*" 2>/dev/null | xargs -n1 basename | sort'
